  "$comment": "Blender-built bedroom models (tools/art/blender/families/bedroom.py). Listed in the base manifest's packs. The materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The beds turn their duvet down (`turn_down`) while a resident sleeps or naps; the futon unfolds into a bed (`unfold`) and stays open.",
